    "turn_idx": 180,
    "turn_text": "It is, but that's why if we have that caveat or qualifier with context specific, what we say is you should have the right to delete your data, but you shouldn't have the right to be forgotten. What that means is if there's something I didn't like about this interview, I shouldn't be able to say, Cara, please delete that from the internet. Or if I committed a crime,",
