    "turn_idx": 369,
    "turn_text": "But what it's saying is that there should be an obligation on these companies to think about what the best cybersecurity platforms are and that they should be an accountability for them to design it. So that government may not know exactly what to do, but these companies should have a legal liability if they aren't coming up with the best designs to protect your data.",
