    "turn_text": "And I think it's just as you've called for your columns, it's just taking a deep breath and reflecting about the larger purpose. It's like being in Congress, or you couldn't spend your whole day thinking about, okay, you have these media interviews on a political side, you have fundraising, you've got these constituent meetings, and you could just go day after day after day. And then at some point you said, well, What am I trying to do? How am I trying to make the nation a better place? And have I achieved that? Or am I so caught up in the machinery? And I think that in the valley, these folks were the underdogs for the longest",
